      "title": "2 DAYS 1 NIGHT CAMP AT SUNWAY LAGOON!",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiqdpcksL-hbWQavDWa3RIU_e_aHexd0SfxBXc42oB6lSFN1LaGX2-cuf_6HHdd6tCYBNgtqnhXl1S2Pt4SGfGiVOJTNeSBKpPqHJNYNTqa-ItkHcsr4YXJo-z8RYx13aPVyOhP5iV90_RSJ4bIHgsPWxcrGsygmB5iuaZtQWMDO_SkJPJ8dZPB-Xx_-w/s1280/photo_6116010271496581780_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"1280\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiqdpcksL-hbWQavDWa3RIU_e_aHexd0SfxBXc42oB6lSFN1LaGX2-cuf_6HHdd6tCYBNgtqnhXl1S2Pt4SGfGiVOJTNeSBKpPqHJNYNTqa-ItkHcsr4YXJo-z8RYx13aPVyOhP5iV90_RSJ4bIHgsPWxcrGsygmB5iuaZtQWMDO_SkJPJ8dZPB-Xx_-w/w640-h360/photo_6116010271496581780_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eHave a camping trip in a theme park from sunrise to night!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eSunway Lagoon will provide you an extension of their Best Day Ever experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhoXXGNeMNToVWpk_k2b37CghtW1JlQr0od7p12vnPx9mTMiMJexiahS7A5S-3Y4jsxlieRScv9CAcxgr4nei98KGqS_IEYNcxz5Ms35b8bjUDdBlvpjFTqB-3cNRaNO_GhQzLMwZCEMyMIxCMN2UpCCDMb8O3MnpY1IlPUsIqjoRYmNo_tS58J8xil-w/s1280/photo_6116010271496581765_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhoXXGNeMNToVWpk_k2b37CghtW1JlQr0od7p12vnPx9mTMiMJexiahS7A5S-3Y4jsxlieRScv9CAcxgr4nei98KGqS_IEYNcxz5Ms35b8bjUDdBlvpjFTqB-3cNRaNO_GhQzLMwZCEMyMIxCMN2UpCCDMb8O3MnpY1IlPUsIqjoRYmNo_tS58J8xil-w/w360-h640/photo_6116010271496581765_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eWith a BBQ meal, private pools, and the option to stay right next to Sunway Lagoon, it is an improved version of your typical camping trip.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5NzuM_E__fk4nZagjt_1QwDePoqP_XZLIVJAO9_jeHuqxmKHSYBlVAAAqIKm5kGCD3kcLOmnXkJfCNdYpdw1cj5efHUEtp8hL8KWOvR8KwqwssUzgYMVbav1XM7Vf8FlJkzWaJhcgCHXPPR2zPGo4fHDKYVZpfaMMBjyeYc-3grJIb8npvDTlAY-67A/s1280/photo_6116010271496581761_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5NzuM_E__fk4nZagjt_1QwDePoqP_XZLIVJAO9_jeHuqxmKHSYBlVAAAqIKm5kGCD3kcLOmnXkJfCNdYpdw1cj5efHUEtp8hL8KWOvR8KwqwssUzgYMVbav1XM7Vf8FlJkzWaJhcgCHXPPR2zPGo4fHDKYVZpfaMMBjyeYc-3grJIb8npvDTlAY-67A/w360-h640/photo_6116010271496581761_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe campground is situated in the center of Sunway Lagoon, where you may spend your evenings beneath a starry sky as the surrounding dunes create a picture-perfect romantic scenario.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eYou may cross another item off your bucket list by camping at Sunway Lagoon luxuriously.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eIt will undoubtedly be the best night of your life!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh077oAp-CePFtdrBitFBpCYL9jWS_9iXiM4n--3KqSswnVkCkDKvukNh0wHGx5uCnRfHifOHZD6vrSx9Ea9nyuj1SzXzqw6jSN2rirnG-A2R0Bojz_9crE9tB3xC-xTB10MT0osJTDNw8ayV4uMqnFYFLhYaiQjBNnCAqgXmpJ0Ivje0JXcmHG6SYpyA/s1280/photo_6118181304450266518_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"1280\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh077oAp-CePFtdrBitFBpCYL9jWS_9iXiM4n--3KqSswnVkCkDKvukNh0wHGx5uCnRfHifOHZD6vrSx9Ea9nyuj1SzXzqw6jSN2rirnG-A2R0Bojz_9crE9tB3xC-xTB10MT0osJTDNw8ayV4uMqnFYFLhYaiQjBNnCAqgXmpJ0Ivje0JXcmHG6SYpyA/w640-h360/photo_6118181304450266518_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe ticket validity and information are based on a fixed date ticket which is only valid on the visiting date.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe minimum group size can vary from 2 persons onwards.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eConfirmation of package is subject to availability and advance booking of 3 days in advance is required and theme park admission is applicable for all park access except Bungy Jump, G Force X, and Go-Kart.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhYjiAhjf_3ExTggOXeyRBe2k0Hqvosx2xPkexZKHQZPOKssCcvK5h9fGXYHb-7oD5Dqy9We1BS4gt0VSz8RAP_eUXRI_55j8LVCJJuDOynCk5lcHxvxM6pM6Ax6Nakks5-vUJQnxqpRKhBBUwv8TNP7fg0imCiOeaHdJRN_uB1KGjsHgvb-YuMKUhNGg/s1280/photo_6118181304450266515_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhYjiAhjf_3ExTggOXeyRBe2k0Hqvosx2xPkexZKHQZPOKssCcvK5h9fGXYHb-7oD5Dqy9We1BS4gt0VSz8RAP_eUXRI_55j8LVCJJuDOynCk5lcHxvxM6pM6Ax6Nakks5-vUJQnxqpRKhBBUwv8TNP7fg0imCiOeaHdJRN_uB1KGjsHgvb-YuMKUhNGg/w360-h640/photo_6118181304450266515_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6hzz6obbyW8rT7BHFoHsCfduPChkAOjN-LnTeP_3koV2mhGsEcysz4Hz6uz6qrurpicbDTl_A6LCH0AqunkFc658UZtacEGo13yr66KeLrLZXjJU12ecYIyO6SH_q2H187yDZ-ec7V1Ck1DNSfgDnXXeZKia2WaxPRStyle9PRVELIVjQ5Zsw-dqUGQ/s1280/photo_6116010271496581779_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6hzz6obbyW8rT7BHFoHsCfduPChkAOjN-LnTeP_3koV2mhGsEcysz4Hz6uz6qrurpicbDTl_A6LCH0AqunkFc658UZtacEGo13yr66KeLrLZXjJU12ecYIyO6SH_q2H187yDZ-ec7V1Ck1DNSfgDnXXeZKia2WaxPRStyle9PRVELIVjQ5Zsw-dqUGQ/w360-h640/photo_6116010271496581779_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe park includes a one-day admission ticket for the whole park.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eOne night stay at Explorer Campsite with a bath towel, room amenities, drinking water, and air conditioning are included in this park.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiccI3xRQ8F2LA--YWnj6HW5sOczB-cQnTfGoetMcyg0hWT4bsnYmzlQIYwsK6o9IiNsVkrlXKwuhguM_GU3wMby7WBjjVrAvZM4M5aFAayKsmO3E6JaccJzIk-RCZNk835bJhLMni1gN28EzlSLVzolI2PO9GQloU5Z7yLjiRbawq3Igj-bK3ugAlL8A/s1280/photo_6116010271496581768_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiccI3xRQ8F2LA--YWnj6HW5sOczB-cQnTfGoetMcyg0hWT4bsnYmzlQIYwsK6o9IiNsVkrlXKwuhguM_GU3wMby7WBjjVrAvZM4M5aFAayKsmO3E6JaccJzIk-RCZNk835bJhLMni1gN28EzlSLVzolI2PO9GQloU5Z7yLjiRbawq3Igj-bK3ugAlL8A/w360-h640/photo_6116010271496581768_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eThere is a complementary breakfast and BBQ for dinner which is also included in the package.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003ePackages are valid from Wednesday to Sunday and the check-in time is from 2pm onwards and checkout is at 12pm.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eRe-entry to the park will not be allowed and all park visitors' wristbands will be removed at the gate upon exit.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eAll wrist tag band is only allowed for entry on the date of purchase.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eGuests may enter via Sunway Lagoon Main Entrance only.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eAll the tickets purchased are non-refunded and no amendment will be entertained.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhY3tbQ6XEomioBPxJKghEiXXvC7jAe6vmGW-lmK02kNjdOc-JA4JkUKy65FyxnaJI1iGV5VUeg7DqmgYZ-glKCM2sj3p1wi1EzhUl-RKzo1NtvOt22bW7roVYvPZH6dC8SavkWViL6_mYaBtWTzPPupGAGyBx2rOf3eb475znVRHSdWA5Ab_H0ALxjSg/s1280/photo_6118181304450266516_y.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"What's Up KL?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1280\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhY3tbQ6XEomioBPxJKghEiXXvC7jAe6vmGW-lmK02kNjdOc-JA4JkUKy65FyxnaJI1iGV5VUeg7DqmgYZ-glKCM2sj3p1wi1EzhUl-RKzo1NtvOt22bW7roVYvPZH6dC8SavkWViL6_mYaBtWTzPPupGAGyBx2rOf3eb475znVRHSdWA5Ab_H0ALxjSg/w360-h640/photo_6118181304450266516_y.jpg\" title=\"What's Up KL?\" width=\"360\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003eAddress: Jalan PJS 11/15, Bandar Sunway, 47500 Petaling Jaya, Selangor\u003cbr /\u003eContact: +603-5639 0000\u003cbr /\u003eWebsite: \u003ca href=\"https://www.sunwaylagoon.com\"\u003ehttps://www.sunwaylagoon.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOperating Hours: 10.00 am - 6.00 pm (Wednesday-Monday) / Closed on Tuesday\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-a